==English==

==={{acronym}}===
'''TUPE'''

# Transfer of Undertakings (Protection of Employment)

===Verb===
(''British colloquial'').  To transfer (an employee or group of employees) to another employer under TUPE regulations.  Most commonly encountered in the passive voice, ''eg'' "Following the outsourcing agreement, the IT department was TUPE'd out to BigSys Corporation."

